msgid ""
"The Anyleafh7 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-4 are available via an"
" JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot and bi-directional DShot, as"
" well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"Anyleafh7 支持最多 8 路 PWM 输出。输出 1-4 通过 JST-SH 连接器引出。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 和双向 "
"DShot，以及所有 PWM 类型。"

